# Final Principle

A repository is not unfinished simply because it can still be improved.

A progressive-intent cycle is complete when its intended outcome has been achieved and further improvement requires a new decision.

**Intent → Build → Validate → Stop**

If additional value is desired:

**New Intent → New Progressive Cycle**

Do not continue without new intent.

